                    // POST /repos/{o}/{r}/check-runs — head_sha is a FIELD,
                    // never a path segment (sha-in-path 404s). github_create
                    // _check_run is MCP-registry-only (not a JS-bridge tool).
                    // details_url + the jobs table (stampLinkBlock) turn the
